{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08972","headline":"移疾会诗客元生与释子法朗因贻诸祠曹 · 韦应物","name":"移疾会诗客元生与释子法朗因贻诸祠曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"对此嘉树林，独有戚戚颜。\n抱瘵知旷职，淹旬非乐闲。\n释子来问讯，诗人亦扣关。\n道同意暂遣，客散疾徐还。\n园径自幽静，玄蝉噪其间。\n高牕瞰远郊，暮色起秋山。\n英曹幸休暇，悢悢心所攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08972.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08972","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}